XGPUI Lab incorporates application source from gpui-luma-color-viz,
commit 623c723097c5fd88219d9d3ebb73fa22d6d64287.
The original source is licensed under Apache-2.0; see LICENSE-APACHE.
The application name and local dependency configuration have been adapted
for xgpui-lab. The original color screens are retained.

Gamut lab content is adapted from xgpui/apps/gamut-lab/src/main.rs,
xgpui/apps/gamut-lab/src/color_main.rs, and the shared CPU references in
xgpui/apps/extensions-web/src/color_samples.rs at commit
73262f80be7e2b9bb8fa5cdc333f1bb3e7421b9e (Apache-2.0).
The shared reference import and application controls were adapted for this app.
Copyright 2022 - 2025 Zed Industries, Inc.

Shader content is adapted from xgpui/apps/paint-lab/src/editor.rs,
main.rs, brushes.rs, portable.rs, shaders/portable-wash.wgsl, and
xgpui/apps/shader-examples/src/examples.rs and minimal.wgsl at commit
73262f80be7e2b9bb8fa5cdc333f1bb3e7421b9e (Apache-2.0).
Editor models and shader sources are retained; navigation and interaction
controls are adapted to Luma. Standalone app launchers are not included.

Color views adapt xgpui/apps/extensions-web/src/color.rs and the shared
color_samples.rs references, together with xgpui-color's documented conversion,
mapping and CPU-gradient examples at commit
73262f80be7e2b9bb8fa5cdc333f1bb3e7421b9e (Apache-2.0).
Controls are adapted to Luma; all Color preview swatches are explicitly sRGB.

Media fixtures and the generated BGRA/NV12 source are adapted from
xgpui/apps/media-lab/src/{fixtures,video_lab,model,ui}.rs.
SVG scene geometry and rendering comparisons are adapted from
xgpui/apps/svg-lab/src/{scene,main,gallery,benchmark}.rs; path-effect fixtures
and panels are adapted from xgpui/apps/media-lab/src/paths.rs.
Source revision: 73262f80be7e2b9bb8fa5cdc333f1bb3e7421b9e (Apache-2.0).
Application navigation and controls are adapted to Luma. The embedded gallery
uses the original ribbon/leaf scene, without the third-party artwork corpus.

Restored Media modes also adapt media-lab/src/float_lab.rs and the shared
apps/web-support/tiled_demo.rs. SVG camera gestures adapt svg-lab/src/camera.rs
at the same source revision and license. External gallery artwork is loaded
from user-selected files; no additional artwork corpus is distributed.

Parley pages adapt xgpui/apps/text-lab/src/{samples,timings,paragraph}.rs
and paragraph/input.rs at revision 73262f80be7e2b9bb8fa5cdc333f1bb3e7421b9e
(Apache-2.0). The editor retains source selection, BiDi navigation, clipboard,
grapheme editing and UTF-16 IME handling. Controls use Luma; Parley font IDs
and raster previews are isolated from the shell's native text backend.
Embedded IBM Plex, Inter Variable and Noto Arabic/Hebrew font fixtures are
licensed under the SIL Open Font License; see licenses/fonts/.

Shader Typography adapts xgpui/apps/shader-examples/src/typography.rs at
revision 73262f80be7e2b9bb8fa5cdc333f1bb3e7421b9e (Apache-2.0). The original
xgpui-shader SelectableText entities, styling and motion effects are retained;
controls are adapted to Luma and animation is paused when the pane is left.

Restored brush/effect galleries and Hermite controls also adapt
paint-lab/src/{brushes,hermite_editor,mesh_tangent}.rs; shadow and border
comparisons adapt shader-examples/src/shadows.rs. Native text diagnostics
and scrolling workloads adapt text-lab/src/workload.rs. Source revision:
73262f80be7e2b9bb8fa5cdc333f1bb3e7421b9e (Apache-2.0).
Interactive application controls are adapted to Luma. Validation launches
the original source lab workers from the selected sibling checkout.
